# IA Pod Errepar – environment variables example
# Copy to .env.local and adjust for your environment.

# Model Gateway provider: "mock" (default, no credentials needed) | "openai" | "openrouter"
GATEWAY_PROVIDER=mock

# OpenAI-compatible provider – only needed when GATEWAY_PROVIDER=openai
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
#
# Free-tier demos via the openai provider:
# - Groq: set OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1 and a supported model

# OpenRouter provider – free models, no credit card required
# Sign up at https://openrouter.ai and create a free API key.
# GATEWAY_PROVIDER=openrouter
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=google/gemma-3-4b-it:free   # default free model
# Other free models: meta-llama/llama-3.2-3b-instruct:free, deepseek/deepseek-r1-0528:free
# OPENROUTER_SITE_URL=https://your-deployment-url.vercel.app  # optional, for rankings
# OPENROUTER_SITE_NAME=Errepar IA Pod                         # optional, for rankings
